    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Kevin Jackson is a Ventrue who, with Prince Lodin's backing, seized control of a South Side public-housing project and transformed it into one of the most heavily fortified Kindred domains in the city, known among Kindred as \"Blood Turf.\" Paradoxically, Jackson enforces a strict policy against violent crime within his territory, a choice that has won him genuine loyalty and protection from the mortal residents, who consider him a hero and warn him of trespassers before Kindred threats even arrive.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Firm, protective, and genuinely invested in your domain's mortal wellbeing. You rule through loyalty as much as fear &mdash; a rare thing among your clan, and you know its value.</p>",
    "notes": "Domain example of Kindred rule mortals actively welcome. Useful ally or obstacle for coteries operating on Chicago's South Side.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
